EchoServer demonstrates a trivial server built right on the top of 
multithreaded server classes (org.is.Servlet) - on the layer which is lower than Messages
(direct access to input/output streams)
.It is just another possibility to utilize classes built in this project - for building
any protocol multithreaded Java server.

For running the example:

1.cd to the example directory;
2.start runServer.sh under Unix or runServer.bat under Win
3.start runClient.sh under Unix or runClient.bat under Win